Santastein is a horror, comedy, fantasy film directed by Manuel Camilion.

3
00:08:30,967 --> 00:08:36,967
When Max Causey was six, he accidentally killed Santa.

4
00:11:21,290 --> 00:11:27,290
12 years later, Max rectifies his mistake by resurrecting him, but soon realizes the creature he
created is a bloodthirsty killer and it's headed right to his friend's Christmas party.

5
